M2-c113 L08 M2 | card: Does the Lagrange remainder give the exact error for a general functio | item: “The Lagrange remainder gives the exact error without further work.”
M2-c114 L08 M3 | card: Does a larger degree always give a smaller bound? | item: “A larger degree always gives a smaller bound.”
M2-c128 L09 M1 | card: Does the upper sum with n rectangles equal the integral? | item: “The upper sum with \(n\) rectangles is the integral.”
