M2-c217 L14 M2 | card: Is reverse mode always the cheaper choice? | item: “Reverse mode is always the cheaper choice.”
M2-c218 L14 M3 | card: Is the tangent of a program the derivative of the function it was mean | item: “The tangent of a program is the derivative of the function it was meant to compute.”
M2-c225 L15 M3 | card: Is the closed disc {x : |x| <= 1} an open set? | item: “The closed disc \(\{x : |x| \le 1\}\) is open because it contains its interior.”
