M2-c248 L16 M1 | card: If both partial derivatives exist at a point, is the function continuo | item: “If both partial derivatives exist at a point, the function is continuous there.”
M2-c249 L16 M3 | card: Does a partial derivative at a use values of f across the whole plane? | item: “A partial derivative at a point depends on the values of \(f\) across the whole plane.”
